      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَايَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطْح</span> [or <i>flat top</i> or <i>roof</i> of a house]
(Az, S, K) <i>upon which one sleeps.</i> (Az, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A place in which dates are put to dry
in the sun.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A great rock in land</i>

<i>containing sand,</i> (K, TA,) or <i>in which 9are no
stones:</i> mentioned by ISd. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَتِ</span>
